    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109469" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπουργ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, 
			contr.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποεργός</span> (q. v.),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rendering service,
				serviceable, conducive to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἀποπήγνυσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.8.15
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὑ.</span> the <i>assistants,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.344.80
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.89.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινός</span>
			<i>a servant of</i> any one, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				176.220
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.8.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρατῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.16
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristaenet.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			 (parox. codd.), s.v.l.</div>
